WEBVTT

00:09:29.815 --> 00:09:33.152
I don't know if people
that are watching know about this

00:09:33.193 --> 00:09:34.653
or read about it in the paper,

00:09:34.653 --> 00:09:37.156
but two years ago,
when there was an extreme freeze

00:09:37.197 --> 00:09:40.909
and the electric generators
failed to produce enough power

00:09:40.951 --> 00:09:43.329
to keep the lights on
and the heat running,

00:09:43.370 --> 00:09:46.540
I talked to neighbors
who were found frozen to death

00:09:46.582 --> 00:09:48.000
in their own living rooms,

00:09:48.042 --> 00:09:50.127
and none of it needed to happen.

00:09:50.169 --> 00:09:52.546
Extreme weather had shut down
the grid before,

00:09:52.546 --> 00:09:56.050
the Railroad Commission had been warned
to weatherize to the grid

00:09:56.091 --> 00:09:57.259
and nothing was done.

00:09:57.301 --> 00:09:59.470
And still the grid
hasn’t been weatherized.

00:09:59.470 --> 00:10:02.848
And so it remains very vulnerable
to another disaster.